dred a day). It records the exact tool definitions, pins them by digest, and writes a signed label to a public RFC 9162 Merkle log whenever a tool set first appears, stays the same, or changes. This snapshot is that record as files.\n\n  * 85,913 listed servers (34,171 remote endpoints, 51,742 packages), plus 3,364 delisted\n  * 40,738 with a recorded tool set; 11,528 changed at least once\n  * 31,660 recorded changes, 2026-09-24 to 2026-10-26\n  * 66,649 distinct tool sets (current ones and every one a change replaced)\n  * 752 servers with a block-tier WARDEN pattern match, 15,273 advise-only\n\nLive view and per-server pages: https://histor.modelmarket.dev · code: https://github.com/alexar76/histor\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/histor/tree)\nciteturn3search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago;     > 💬 **[Issues](https://github.com/alexar76/histor/issues)** · **[Pull requests](https://github.com/alexar76/histor/pulls)** both welcome. ...     | [AIMarket Hub](https://modelmarket.dev) | lists `histor.check@v1` in the catalogue |\n\n## histor\n\n\nSecurityObservability\n\nby alexar76\n\nOverviewSchemaSourceRelated ServersDiscussionsAdmin\n\nPython\n\nRemote\n\n  * histor\n\n  * deploy\n\n  * docs\n\n  * .github\n\n  * histor\n\n  * sandbox\n\n  * scanner\n\n  * scripts\n\n  * tests\n\n\nREADME.md\n    \n    `<!-- aicom-mirror-notice -->\n    > **🔄 Synced from a monorepo — but with a live history.** `histor` mirrors the\n    > canonical AI-Factory monorepo. History here is append-only (no force-push).\n    > **Pull requests are welcome** — merged PRs are imported back into the monorepo\n    > and re-synced here, so your contribution becomes canonical.\n    > 💬 **[Issues](https://github.com/alexar76/histor/issues)** · **[Pull requests](https://github.com/alexar76/histor/pulls)** both welcome.\n    \n    # HISTOR\n    \n    <!-- aicom-readme-badges -->\n    <p align=\"center